    "solution_html": "Zacznijmy od rysunku.<br><img src=\"js/data/zi_images/3c5475a31526.gif\" alt=\"PIC\" class=\"zi-math-img\"><br><br> Jeżeli oznaczymy <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/92f0783ad635.gif\" alt=\"BC = a\" class=\"zi-math-img\"><br> <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/523d64ff5cd4.gif\" alt=\"-a--= cos60∘ = 1- ⇒ AB = 2a AB 2 AC ∘ √ -- √ -- ----= tg 60 = 3 ⇒ AC = 3a. a\" class=\"zi-math-img\"><br> Skorzystamy teraz ze wozru na pole trójkąta <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/70cca782fe1f.gif\" alt=\"P = 1(a + b + c)r 2\" class=\"zi-math-img\"><br> <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/a52b6b7d6311.gif\" alt=\"√ -- 1 √ -- 3a+ 3a P = -(a + 2a + 3a )⋅1 = ---------. 2 2\" class=\"zi-math-img\"><br> Z drugiej strony,<br> <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/44874fcd50ff.gif\" alt=\"√ -- 1 3a2 P = --⋅AC ⋅CB = -----. 2 2\" class=\"zi-math-img\"><br> Zatem<br> <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/4d999839384e.gif\" alt=\"√ -- √ -- 3a + 3a 3a2 ----------= ------ 2√ -- √ -- 2 3+ 3 = 3a 3 √ -- a = √---+ 1 = 3+ 1. 3\" class=\"zi-math-img\"><br> <br>Odpowiedź: <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/5b7fb2c2ff2b.gif\" alt=\"√ -- √ -- √ -- 3 + 1,2 3 + 2 ,3 + 3\" class=\"zi-math-img\">",
