    "solution": "Jeżeli podstawimy [x 7 = t] [2 t + 4t− 5 = 0 Δ = 16 + 20 = 36 t = − 5, t = 1. 1 2] Zatem [x 7 = 1 ⇒ x = 0.] Odpowiedź: [x = 0]",
    "solution_html": "Jeżeli podstawimy <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/20e2fbc4eb8e.gif\" alt=\"x 7 = t\" class=\"zi-math-img\"><br> <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/f174a0e0106c.gif\" alt=\"2 t + 4t− 5 = 0 Δ = 16 + 20 = 36 t = − 5, t = 1. 1 2\" class=\"zi-math-img\"><br> Zatem<br> <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/22fc9424f978.gif\" alt=\"x 7 = 1 ⇒ x = 0.\" class=\"zi-math-img\"><br> <br>Odpowiedź: <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/19e720e81c48.gif\" alt=\"x = 0\" class=\"zi-math-img\">",
