    "solution": "Korzystamy ze wzoru[( ) ′ ′ ′ f- = f-g-−-fg-- g g 2]na pochodną ilorazu. Sposób I Zauważmy najpierw, że [8x3 + 4x2 + 2 (8x3 + 4x2 + 3) − 1 1 f(x) = --3-----2-----= -----3-----2--------= 1− --3-----2----. 8x + 4x + 3 8x + 4x + 3 8x + 4x + 3] W takim razie [3 2 2 2 f′(x) = 0 − 0-⋅(8x--+-4x--+-3)-−-1-⋅(24x--+-8x-)= ---2-4x-+--8x----. (8x3 + 4x2 + 3)2 (8x 3 + 4x 2 + 3 )2] Sposób II Liczymy [( 8x 3 + 4x 2 + 2 ) ′ f′(x) = -------------- = 8x 3 + 4x 2 + 3 (8x 3 + 4x2 + 2)′(8x 3 + 4x2 + 3)− (8x3 + 4x2 + 2)(8x3 + 4x 2 + 3)′ = ----------------------------3------2----2------------------------- = (8x + 4x + 3) (2 4x2 + 8x)(8x3 + 4x 2 + 3) − (8x 3 + 4x 2 + 2)(24x2 + 8x) = ---------------------(8x3 +-4x2-+-3)2-------------------- = (2-4x2 +-8x)(8x3-+-4x-2 +-3-−-(8x-3 +-4x-2 +-2)) ----24x2-+-8x---- = (8x3 + 4x2 + 3)2 = (8x 3 + 4x 2 + 3)2.] Odpowiedź: A",
    "solution_html": "Korzystamy ze wzoru<br><img src=\"js/data/zi_images/ebd91033f1c5.gif\" alt=\"( ) ′ ′ ′ f- = f-g-−-fg-- g g 2\" class=\"zi-math-img\"><br><br>na pochodną ilorazu.<br> Sposób I<br><br> Zauważmy najpierw, że<br> <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/3d71b353e2c1.gif\" alt=\"8x3 + 4x2 + 2 (8x3 + 4x2 + 3) − 1 1 f(x) = --3-----2-----= -----3-----2--------= 1− --3-----2----. 8x + 4x + 3 8x + 4x + 3 8x + 4x + 3\" class=\"zi-math-img\"><br> W takim razie<br> <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/9be0c2ebd034.gif\" alt=\"3 2 2 2 f′(x) = 0 − 0-⋅(8x--+-4x--+-3)-−-1-⋅(24x--+-8x-)= ---2-4x-+--8x----. (8x3 + 4x2 + 3)2 (8x 3 + 4x 2 + 3 )2\" class=\"zi-math-img\"><br> Sposób II<br><br> Liczymy<br> <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/a7eb9ee86fe0.gif\" alt=\"( 8x 3 + 4x 2 + 2 ) ′ f′(x) = -------------- = 8x 3 + 4x 2 + 3 (8x 3 + 4x2 + 2)′(8x 3 + 4x2 + 3)− (8x3 + 4x2 + 2)(8x3 + 4x 2 + 3)′ = ----------------------------3------2----2------------------------- = (8x + 4x + 3) (2 4x2 + 8x)(8x3 + 4x 2 + 3) − (8x 3 + 4x 2 + 2)(24x2 + 8x) = ---------------------(8x3 +-4x2-+-3)2-------------------- = (2-4x2 +-8x)(8x3-+-4x-2 +-3-−-(8x-3 +-4x-2 +-2)) ----24x2-+-8x---- = (8x3 + 4x2 + 3)2 = (8x 3 + 4x 2 + 3)2.\" class=\"zi-math-img\"><br> <br>Odpowiedź: A",
