    "solution": "Korzystając ze wzoru [cos2α = 1− 2sin2 α,] mamy [( ) ( ) 1− 2 sin2 x+ π- + 4 sin x + π- = 5-. 3 3 2] Po podstawieniu [( ) t = sin x+ π3-] [2t2 − 4t + 3-= 0. 2] Dalej, [Δ = 16 − 12 = 4] , [1 t = 2] lub [3 t = 2] . Drugi z pierwiastków odrzucamy, bo [sinx ∈ [− 1,1 ]] . Zatem [( π) 1 sin x + 3- = 2] , czyli [x+ π- = π- + 2kπ lub x + π- = 5-π + 2k π 3 6 3 6 π- π- x = − 6 + 2kπ lub x = 2 + 2kπ .] Odpowiedź: [x = − π-+ 2kπ 6] lub [x = π-+ 2k π 2] , [k ∈ C]",
    "solution_html": "Korzystając ze wzoru<br> <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/91ec92bfbc83.png\" alt=\"cos2α = 1− 2sin2 α,\" class=\"zi-math-img\"><br> mamy<br> <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/363912226c1e.png\" alt=\"( ) ( ) 1− 2 sin2 x+ π- + 4 sin x + π- = 5-. 3 3 2\" class=\"zi-math-img\"><br> Po podstawieniu <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/a84b33ea66e2.png\" alt=\"( ) t = sin x+ π3-\" class=\"zi-math-img\"><br> <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/eddaefa52bfd.png\" alt=\"2t2 − 4t + 3-= 0. 2\" class=\"zi-math-img\"><br> Dalej, <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/52806bd19efd.png\" alt=\"Δ = 16 − 12 = 4\" class=\"zi-math-img\">, <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/578ef80ee816.png\" alt=\"1 t = 2\" class=\"zi-math-img\"> lub <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/41e7e9399ca2.png\" alt=\"3 t = 2\" class=\"zi-math-img\">. Drugi z pierwiastków odrzucamy, bo <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/61dfb9b785e0.png\" alt=\"sinx ∈ [− 1,1 ]\" class=\"zi-math-img\">. Zatem <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/523f709f0d49.png\" alt=\"( π) 1 sin x + 3- = 2\" class=\"zi-math-img\">, czyli<br> <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/36051704dedb.png\" alt=\"x+ π- = π- + 2kπ lub x + π- = 5-π + 2k π 3 6 3 6 π- π- x = − 6 + 2kπ lub x = 2 + 2kπ .\" class=\"zi-math-img\"><br> <br>Odpowiedź: <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/f92106f50bad.png\" alt=\"x = − π-+ 2kπ 6\" class=\"zi-math-img\"> lub <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/a8fa43640703.png\" alt=\"x = π-+ 2k π 2\" class=\"zi-math-img\">, <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/49a1af6f7224.png\" alt=\"k ∈ C\" class=\"zi-math-img\">",
