    "solution": "Podstawiamy [t = tg x] [2 √ -- 3t + 2 3t− 3 = 0 3-2 √ -- 3- 2 t + 3t − 2 = 0 √ --2 Δ = 3+√ -9 = 1√2-= (2 3) √ -- √ -- √ -- − 3 − 2 3 √ -- − 3 + 2 3 3 t = -------------= − 3 ∨ t = -------------= ---. 3 3 3] Zatem [-- √ -- √ 3 tg x = − 3 ∨ tg x = ---- 3 x = − π-+ kπ ∨ x = π-+ kπ. 3 6] Odpowiedź: [x = − π3-+ kπ , x = π6-+ kπ , k ∈ C]",
    "solution_html": "Podstawiamy <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/72063a9f5c19.gif\" alt=\"t = tg x\" class=\"zi-math-img\"><br> <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/62823e354c3d.gif\" alt=\"2 √ -- 3t + 2 3t− 3 = 0 3-2 √ -- 3- 2 t + 3t − 2 = 0 √ --2 Δ = 3+√ -9 = 1√2-= (2 3) √ -- √ -- √ -- − 3 − 2 3 √ -- − 3 + 2 3 3 t = -------------= − 3 ∨ t = -------------= ---. 3 3 3\" class=\"zi-math-img\"><br> Zatem<br> <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/3054aa587231.gif\" alt=\"-- √ -- √ 3 tg x = − 3 ∨ tg x = ---- 3 x = − π-+ kπ ∨ x = π-+ kπ. 3 6\" class=\"zi-math-img\"><br> <br>Odpowiedź: <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/acfc2d04e971.gif\" alt=\"x = − π3-+ kπ , x = π6-+ kπ , k ∈ C\" class=\"zi-math-img\">",
