    "statement": "Rozwiąż równanie [4 2 2sin x = cos x]",
    "statement_html": "Rozwiąż równanie <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/de72bee4b35c.gif\" alt=\"4 2 2sin x = cos x\" class=\"zi-math-img\">",
    "solution": "Liczymy [4 2 2sin x = cos x 2sin4 x = 1 − sin2x .] Podstawiamy teraz [t = sin2x] [2t2 + t− 1 = 0 Δ = 1 + 8 = 9 −-1-−-3 −-1-+-3 1- t = 4 = − 1 ∨ t = 4 = 2.] Mamy zatem [2 1- sin x = 2 √ -- sinx = ± --2- 2 x = ± π- + kπ . 4] Odpowiedź: [x = ± π-+ kπ ,k ∈ C 4]",
    "solution_html": "Liczymy<br> <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/a1195372c093.gif\" alt=\"4 2 2sin x = cos x 2sin4 x = 1 − sin2x .\" class=\"zi-math-img\"><br> Podstawiamy teraz <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/27c678a98226.gif\" alt=\"t = sin2x\" class=\"zi-math-img\"><br> <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/aaa767d1a09a.gif\" alt=\"2t2 + t− 1 = 0 Δ = 1 + 8 = 9 −-1-−-3 −-1-+-3 1- t = 4 = − 1 ∨ t = 4 = 2.\" class=\"zi-math-img\"><br> Mamy zatem<br> <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/1bd3375383f8.gif\" alt=\"2 1- sin x = 2 √ -- sinx = ± --2- 2 x = ± π- + kπ . 4\" class=\"zi-math-img\"><br> <br>Odpowiedź: <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/b103e680e971.gif\" alt=\"x = ± π-+ kπ ,k ∈ C 4\" class=\"zi-math-img\">",
