"ADC\" class=\"zi-math-img\">.<br> <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/e99c3eab848a.gif\" alt=\"AD DC -----= ----- sin β sin α 2 11 33 -----= 38--= --- sin β 9 8 2 16 sin β = 33-= 33. 8\" class=\"zi-math-img\"><br> <br>Odpowiedź: <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/af2feacadf82.gif\" alt=\"1363\" class=\"zi-math-img\">",
