    "solution_html": "Oznaczmy szukane liczby przez <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/4023aff39a5f.gif\" alt=\"a − r,a,a + r\" class=\"zi-math-img\"><br> <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/000a22233ac1.gif\" alt=\"a − r+ a+ a+ r = 15 ⇒ 3a = 1 5 ⇒ a = 5.\" class=\"zi-math-img\"><br> Zatem szukamy liczb postaci <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/7ea8851fffde.gif\" alt=\"5− r,5\" class=\"zi-math-img\"><br>Wiemy ponadto, że liczby <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/f24866e73fcb.gif\" alt=\"5 − r,4,5 + r\" class=\"zi-math-img\"><br> <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/9d357ee8b8b7.gif\" alt=\"42 = (5 − r)(5 + r) 2 16 = 2 5− r r2 = 9 ⇒ r = ± 3.\" class=\"zi-math-img\"><br> Dla <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/792a2c0101fa.gif\" alt=\"r = − 3\" class=\"zi-math-img\"> mamy ciąg <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/392c2df0cf5e.gif\" alt=\"(8,5,2)\" class=\"zi-math-img\">, a dla <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/3b4f2a1f28ad.gif\" alt=\"r = 3\" class=\"zi-math-img\"> ciąg <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/61f021d09d36.gif\" alt=\"(2,5,8 )\" class=\"zi-math-img\">.  <br>Odpowiedź: <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/02529292f2ed.gif\" alt=\"(8,5,2),(2,5 ,8)\" class=\"zi-math-img\">",
