    "statement_html": "Rozwiąż równanie <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/37dae5847a7f.png\" alt=\"2 2 2 (cos2x + cosx) + (cos x+ 1) = cos x− 2cos 2x\" class=\"zi-math-img\">",
    "solution": "Przekształcamy równanie [2 2 2 (cos2x + co sx) + (cos x+ 1) = cos x− 2cos 2x cos2 2x+ 2co s2x cosx + co s2x + cos2 x+ 2cos x+ 1 = cos2 x− 2co s2x cos2 2x+ 2co s2x cosx + co s2x + 2 cosx + 1 + 2 cos2x = 0.] Ponieważ [2 cos2x = 2co s x − 1] [(2t2 − 1)2 + 2(2t2 − 1)t+ t2 + 2t+ 1+ 2(2t2 − 1 ) = 0 4 2 3 2 2 4t − 4t + 1+ 4t − 2t + t + 2t+ 1 + 4t − 2 = 0 4t4 + 4t3 + t2 = 0 2 2 t (4t + 4t+ 1) = 0 t2(2t+ 1)2 = 0 t = 0 ∨ t = − 1-. 2] Zatem [cos x = 0 ∨ co sx = − 1- { } 2 π- 3π- { π- π-} x ∈ 2 , 2 ∨ x ∈ π − 3,π + 3 { } x ∈ π-, 2π-, 4π-, 3π . 2 3 3 2] Odpowiedź: [{ } x ∈ π-, 2π, 4π-, 3π 2 3 3 2]",
    "solution_html": "Przekształcamy równanie<br> <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/a75ed534b690.png\" alt=\"2 2 2 (cos2x + co sx) + (cos x+ 1) = cos x− 2cos 2x cos2 2x+ 2co s2x cosx + co s2x + cos2 x+ 2cos x+ 1 = cos2 x− 2co s2x cos2 2x+ 2co s2x cosx + co s2x + 2 cosx + 1 + 2 cos2x = 0.\" class=\"zi-math-img\"><br> Ponieważ <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/5ad9d26e3dae.png\" alt=\"2 cos2x = 2co s x − 1\" class=\"zi-math-img\"><br> <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/d05054067670.png\" alt=\"(2t2 − 1)2 + 2(2t2 − 1)t+ t2 + 2t+ 1+ 2(2t2 − 1 ) = 0 4 2 3 2 2 4t − 4t + 1+ 4t − 2t + t + 2t+ 1 + 4t − 2 = 0 4t4 + 4t3 + t2 = 0 2 2 t (4t + 4t+ 1) = 0 t2(2t+ 1)2 = 0 t = 0 ∨ t = − 1-. 2\" class=\"zi-math-img\"><br> Zatem<br> <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/46e4dd4ff86d.png\" alt=\"cos x = 0 ∨ co sx = − 1- { } 2 π- 3π- { π- π-} x ∈ 2 , 2 ∨ x ∈ π − 3,π + 3 { } x ∈ π-, 2π-, 4π-, 3π . 2 3 3 2\" class=\"zi-math-img\"><br> <br>Odpowiedź: <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/7488524ff76f.png\" alt=\"{ } x ∈ π-, 2π, 4π-, 3π 2 3 3 2\" class=\"zi-math-img\">",
