    "statement_html": "Liczby <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/835852dc8ff7.png\" alt=\"a1,a2,a3,...,an\" class=\"zi-math-img\"><br> <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/9e07e11169a8.png\" alt=\"S = a1 + a2 + a3 + ⋅ ⋅⋅+ an 1 1 1 1 T = ---+ ---+ --+ ⋅⋅⋅+ --, a1 a 2 a3 an\" class=\"zi-math-img\"><br> oblicz iloczyn <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/26a82198ee06.png\" alt=\"I = a1a2a 3⋅⋅⋅an\" class=\"zi-math-img\">",
    "solution": "Jeżeli zapiszemy [n− 1 an = a1q] [S = a1 + a2 + a3 + ⋅⋅⋅+ an = = a1 + a1q + a1q2 + ⋅⋅⋅+ a1qn−1 = a1(1 + q + ⋅⋅⋅ + qn−1) T = -1-+ 1-+ 1--+ ⋅⋅⋅+ -1-= a1 a2 a3 an 1 1 1 1 qn− 1 + ⋅⋅⋅+ q2 + q + 1 = ---+ ----+ -----+ ⋅⋅⋅ + ------- = ----------------------- a1 a1q a1q2 a1qn− 1 a1qn−1 S- T = ---a1-- = --S---- ⇒ a 2qn−1 = -S. a1qn −1 a21qn−1 1 T] A teraz zobaczmy co mamy obliczyć [2 n− 1 n 1+2+ ⋅⋅⋅+ (n−1) I = a1a2a3 ⋅⋅⋅an = a1(a1q)(a1q ) ⋅⋅⋅(a1q ) = a1q = n(n−1) ( ) n2 = an1q--2-- = (a 21qn −1)n2 = -S T] Zauważmy, że powyższy rachunek ma sens, bo z założenia [n 2] jest liczbą całkowitą.  Odpowiedź: [( ) n S- 2 I = T]",
    "solution_html": "Jeżeli zapiszemy <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/d51f33bc334a.png\" alt=\"n− 1 an = a1q\" class=\"zi-math-img\"><br> <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/af2101efa59f.png\" alt=\"S = a1 + a2 + a3 + ⋅⋅⋅+ an = = a1 + a1q + a1q2 + ⋅⋅⋅+ a1qn−1 = a1(1 + q + ⋅⋅⋅ + qn−1) T = -1-+ 1-+ 1--+ ⋅⋅⋅+ -1-= a1 a2 a3 an 1 1 1 1 qn− 1 + ⋅⋅⋅+ q2 + q + 1 = ---+ ----+ -----+ ⋅⋅⋅ + ------- = ----------------------- a1 a1q a1q2 a1qn− 1 a1qn−1 S- T = ---a1-- = --S---- ⇒ a 2qn−1 = -S. a1qn −1 a21qn−1 1 T\" class=\"zi-math-img\"><br> A teraz zobaczmy co mamy obliczyć<br> <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/be7dc6bba7b0.png\" alt=\"2 n− 1 n 1+2+ ⋅⋅⋅+ (n−1) I = a1a2a3 ⋅⋅⋅an = a1(a1q)(a1q ) ⋅⋅⋅(a1q ) = a1q = n(n−1) ( ) n2 = an1q--2-- = (a 21qn −1)n2 = -S T\" class=\"zi-math-img\"><br> Zauważmy, że powyższy rachunek ma sens, bo z założenia <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/26d2375147e5.png\" alt=\"n 2\" class=\"zi-math-img\"> jest liczbą całkowitą.  <br>Odpowiedź: <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/003d7c2673f5.png\" alt=\"( ) n S- 2 I = T\" class=\"zi-math-img\">",
