    "statement_html": "Rozwiąż równanie <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/6cf1092630bc.gif\" alt=\"1 log4(1 + log3[1 + log2(x + 3)]) = 2\" class=\"zi-math-img\">",
    "solution": "Liczymy [1 lo g4(1+ lo g3[1+ log 2(x+ 3)]) = lo g44 2 lo g (1+ lo g [1+ log (x+ 3)]) = lo g 2 4 3 2 4 1 + log3[1 + log2(x + 3)] = 2 lo g3[1+ log 2(x+ 3)] = 1 lo g3[1+ log 2(x+ 3)] = lo g33 1 + log2(x + 3 ) = 3 lo g (x + 3) = 2 2 lo g2(x + 3) = log2 22 x + 3 = 4 ⇒ x = 1 .] Na koniec wypada sprawdzić, czy [x = 1] [log (1 + log [1 + log (1 + 3)]) = log (1 + log (1 + 2)) = lo g 2 = 1. 4 3 2 4 3 4 2] Odpowiedź: [x = 1]",
    "solution_html": "Liczymy<br> <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/912432206062.gif\" alt=\"1 lo g4(1+ lo g3[1+ log 2(x+ 3)]) = lo g44 2 lo g (1+ lo g [1+ log (x+ 3)]) = lo g 2 4 3 2 4 1 + log3[1 + log2(x + 3)] = 2 lo g3[1+ log 2(x+ 3)] = 1 lo g3[1+ log 2(x+ 3)] = lo g33 1 + log2(x + 3 ) = 3 lo g (x + 3) = 2 2 lo g2(x + 3) = log2 22 x + 3 = 4 ⇒ x = 1 .\" class=\"zi-math-img\"><br> Na koniec wypada sprawdzić, czy <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/6e494ec1bdc4.gif\" alt=\"x = 1\" class=\"zi-math-img\"><br> <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/8425c5a80f3f.gif\" alt=\"log (1 + log [1 + log (1 + 3)]) = log (1 + log (1 + 2)) = lo g 2 = 1. 4 3 2 4 3 4 2\" class=\"zi-math-img\"><br> <br>Odpowiedź: <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/a02632ed275a.gif\" alt=\"x = 1\" class=\"zi-math-img\">",
