    "solution": "Oznaczmy [AB = CD = 2a] , [AD = BC = 2b] i [∡BAD = α] .[PIC] Mamy zatem [PARD = 1AR ⋅AD sin α = ab sin α 2 1- PCDS = 2CD ⋅CS sin α = ab sinα 1 1 PRBS = -RB ⋅BS sin(180∘ − α) = -ab sin α. 2 2] Stąd [PRSD = PABCD − PARD − PCDS − PRBS = = 4ab sinα − absinα − absinα − 1ab sin α = 2 1- 3- 3- = 2ab sinα − 2ab sin α = 2ab sin α = 8 ⋅PABCD .]",
