    "solution": "Wiemy, że [2 2 48 = a − b = (a − b)(a + b) 256 = a2 + 2ab + b2 = (a + b)2] Mamy natomiast obliczyć [a2 − 2ab + b2 = (a− b)2.] Sposób I Liczymy [2 (a−--b)2(a+-b-)2 [(a−--b)(a+--b)]2 482- (a − b) = (a+ b )2 = (a + b)2 = 256 = 9.] Sposób II Jeżeli [2 (a+ b) = 256] to [a+ b = ± 16] . Wtedy z równości [48 = (a− b)(a+ b)] mamy [(a− b) = ± 3] . Zatem [2 (a − b) = 9] .  Odpowiedź: A",
    "solution_html": "Wiemy, że<br> <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/e0d65f52e27a.gif\" alt=\"2 2 48 = a − b = (a − b)(a + b) 256 = a2 + 2ab + b2 = (a + b)2\" class=\"zi-math-img\"><br> Mamy natomiast obliczyć<br> <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/e8ea6d4ca0e2.gif\" alt=\"a2 − 2ab + b2 = (a− b)2.\" class=\"zi-math-img\"><br> Sposób I<br><br> Liczymy<br> <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/1a9828d2e50e.gif\" alt=\"2 (a−--b)2(a+-b-)2 [(a−--b)(a+--b)]2 482- (a − b) = (a+ b )2 = (a + b)2 = 256 = 9.\" class=\"zi-math-img\"><br> Sposób II<br><br> Jeżeli <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/630e8ad070ae.gif\" alt=\"2 (a+ b) = 256\" class=\"zi-math-img\"> to <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/70f7755005a7.gif\" alt=\"a+ b = ± 16\" class=\"zi-math-img\">. Wtedy z równości<br> <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/482dea786022.gif\" alt=\"48 = (a− b)(a+ b)\" class=\"zi-math-img\"><br> mamy <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/af210379b394.gif\" alt=\"(a− b) = ± 3\" class=\"zi-math-img\">. Zatem <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/ec5658c03bf8.gif\" alt=\"2 (a − b) = 9\" class=\"zi-math-img\">.  <br>Odpowiedź: A",
