    "solution_html": "Przekształcamy podane równanie.<br> <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/421c91a38123.gif\" alt=\"( ) √ 9−x−1 ( ) −√1+√9−x 5- 2- 9−x−5 2 = 5 √ ---- −1+√9−x ( 5) 9−x−1 ( 5) −-√9−x−5 -- = -- 2 2 √ ------ √ ------ − 1 + 9 − x 9− x− 1 = − -√------------. 9 − x − 5\" class=\"zi-math-img\"><br> Podstawmy <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/cf715ffba578.gif\" alt=\"√ ------ 9− x = t\" class=\"zi-math-img\"><br> <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/6d2440bdd87e.gif\" alt=\"− 1 + t t− 1 = − ------- t− 5 −-1-+-t+--(t−-1-)(t−-5) = 0 t − 5 − 1 + t+ t2 − 6t + 5 -------------------- = 0 t− 5 t2 − 5t+ 4 = 0 Δ = 25 − 16 = 9 t1 = 1, t2 = 4 .\" class=\"zi-math-img\"><br> Daje to nam odpowiednio<br> <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/bd1c4b97bbec.gif\" alt=\"√ ------ 9− x = 1 ⇒ 9 − x = 1 ⇒ x = 8 √ ------ 9− x = 4 ⇒ 9 − x = 16 ⇒ x = − 7.\" class=\"zi-math-img\"><br> <br>Odpowiedź: <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/3f9b045b3087.gif\" alt=\"x = − 7\" class=\"zi-math-img\"> lub <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/4f81655be2a8.gif\" alt=\"x = 8\" class=\"zi-math-img\">",
