    "solution_html": "Liczymy<br> <img src=\"js/data/zi_images/f421a0f1a671.gif\" alt=\"(ctg4 4∘ + tg 226∘) ⋅cos 406∘ -----------------∘-----------− ctg 72∘ctg 18∘ = cos 316 (ctg(90-∘ −-46-∘)+-tg(1-80∘ +-46∘))⋅-cos(360∘-+-46∘) ∘ ∘ ∘ = cos(270 ∘ + 4 6∘) − ctg(9 0 − 1 8 )ctg 18 = ∘ ∘ ∘ = (tg-46-+--tg-46-)-⋅cos-46- − tg1 8∘ctg1 8∘ = sin 46∘ = 2 tg 46∘ ctg 46∘ − 1 = 2 − 1 = 1.\" class=\"zi-math-img\"><br> <br>Odpowiedź: 1",
